    <mxCell id="e33" value="session invalid → halt" style="edgeStyle=isometricEdgeStyle;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=9;endArrow=classic;fontColor=#b85450;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b_probe" target="b_orch">
      <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

    <mxCell id="explainer" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font size=&quot;14&quot;&gt;Explainer — how the system runs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;FlowJob is a hybrid pipeline: deterministic Python drives the flow, LLM agents are processors, SQLite is the single source of truth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Scout&lt;/b&gt; — builds LinkedIn queries from resume preferences (target_roles, work_types, locations), scrapes Easy-Apply-only jobs, dedups via sha256 id.&lt;br&gt;src/agents/scout.py · orchestrator.py:34-91&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Analyst&lt;/b&gt; — LLM fit scoring → FitScore; below min_fit_score → SKIPPED.&lt;br&gt;src/agents/analyst.py · orchestrator.py:186-206&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Tailor&lt;/b&gt; — receives safe resume (no PII), returns JSON Resume; contact info re-injected locally at the edge.&lt;br&gt;src/agents/tailor.py:119-131&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4. Editor&lt;/b&gt; — QA on PDF text vs JD: keyword coverage, fact-check, tone audit; feedback loop, max 1 retry.&lt;br&gt;src/agents/editor.py · orchestrator.py:238-268&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5. Doc Factory&lt;/b&gt; — Jinja2 HTML → Playwright print-to-PDF → PyMuPDF ATS text check.&lt;br&gt;src/utils/document_generator.py:28-68&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6. Approval gate&lt;/b&gt; — notify-send + CLI y/N; pipeline never auto-submits.&lt;br&gt;orchestrator.py:149-157 · 282-303&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7. Applicator&lt;/b&gt; — headed Playwright Easy Apply with temporal jitter; unknown fields → screenshot + human input.&lt;br&gt;src/agents/applicator.py:34-105&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Guards&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Session health probe gates every cycle; CAPTCHA or login redirect halts immediately (src/tools/browser.py:19-60 · orchestrator.py:308-311).&lt;br&gt;• Errors land in ErrorRecord; after 3 retries job → FAILED (DLQ) (orchestrator.py:93-147).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Architecture constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Deterministic orchestration — no LLM decides pipeline flow (AGENTS.md · design_spec.md §1).&lt;br&gt;• PII boundary — LLM never sees contact info (resume_parser.py:52-60).&lt;br&gt;• Watch mode sleeps 45-90 min with jitter between cycles (cli.py:90-104)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#333333;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="2100" y="40" width="470" height="720" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

